/// Re-export of hk's configuration schema that this package's builtins are
/// written against.
///
/// The import below is the single place that pins the hk version. Builtins
/// import this module instead of repeating the version. Consumers amend this
/// module, or amend hk's `Config.pkl` at the same version: `Config.Step`
/// objects built from a different hk version are different types.
module hk_config.Config

amends "package://github.com/jdx/hk/releases/download/v2.10.0/hk@2.10.0#/Config.pkl"
